config TZDRIVER
	tristate "Huawei iTrustee OS TrustZone client driver"
	default y
	depends on ARM64
	help
	  This driver provides support for communicating with Huawei iTrustee
	  Secure OS running in ARM TrustZone, creating the /dev/tc_ns_client device node.
	  It is required for the hardware fingerprint sensor, security enclaves,
	  and DRM protected media pipelines on Kirin 990 / Huawei Qingyun L410.

	  If unsure, say Y.
